cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in teaching, research or a course, please cite it as below."
title: "Isometric Chess Academy & Studio"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, offline, bilingual chess studio in one HTML page.
  It provides full international chess rules on a 2.5D isometric Canvas
  board, a piece inspector, a language-aware beginner coach, a blunder
  guard with explanatory undo, five puzzle drills, synthesized Web Audio,
  localStorage persistence and PGN/JSON export.
